1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:02,780
你好啊
How you doing?

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:03,840
我是菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy.

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:05,760
我要如何才能让你张口问
What do I have to do to get you to ask

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,940
"我要如何才能让你看上这辆车"
"What do I have to do to get you into this car today?"

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,720
要不 我们先来个试驾你看怎么样
Well, why don't we start it with a test drive?

6
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:11,700
我去拿钥匙
I'll get the keys.

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,480
听起来不错
Sounds good.

8
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,460
正合我意啊
Right where I want him.

9
00:00:17,067 --> 00:00:18,377
快过来 瞅瞅这个
Come here. Come look at this.

10
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,300
一旦你偏离行车道 这玩意儿就会提醒你
This thing warns you if you deviate from your lane.

11
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,580
我的车 我老婆也具有相同功能
In my car, that's my wife.

12
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,780
"安德瑞 你要是拿我生命冒险
"Andre, if you try to kill me,

13
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,840
老娘就先收了你"
I swear I will kill you!"

14
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:31,000
我想接下来陪伴我39个月的就会是这辆车了
Well, I guess this is what I'll be driving for the next 39 months.

15
00:00:32,286 --> 00:00:33,820
休怪我观察力太明锐
This is my D.N.A. talking,

16
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:35,620
但你似乎并没有很兴奋满足
But you do not seem sufficiently excited

17
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,540
这可是一辆全新的凯迪拉克啊
about the prospect of driving a new Cadillac.

18
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:40,040
没 我兴奋得很 只是一直都是老一套
No, it's great. I've just leased the same thing forever.

19
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,080
但内心深处其实想弄点刺激的
Part of me wants to shake things up.

20
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,720
我也说不清
I don't know.

21
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:47,140
比如换一个...
Get something like...

22
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:47,640
那样的
Like that.

23
00:00:49,874 --> 00:00:52,108
克里克上校风范 赞啊
Colonel Klink, that is nice.

24
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:56,240
我们第一次带着莉莉坐城铁
We took Lily on her first train ride.

25
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,820
去唐人街的短途路程
Just a quick trip to chinatown.

26
00:00:58,140 --> 00:00:59,040
原本还担心她会误以为
I was worried she would think

27
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,440
我们要把她送回越南
We were taking her back to Vietnam,

28
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,620
不过她表现还好
But she seemed okay.

29
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:02,920
可不是嘛
Yeah, yeah.

30
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:05,220
可能因为她离开越南时还只是个婴儿吧
Possibly because she was an infant when she left vietnam.

31
00:01:06,028 --> 00:01:07,800
其次 越南和中国是两码事
Also, Vietnam is not China.

32
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,860
不过 我带上根棒棒糖以防万一
Well, I had a lollipop with me just in case.

33
00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:13,200
我真开心我们能这么做
I love that we're doing this.

34
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:15,380
慢慢涉足她生活的城市对她很重要
It's important for her to explore the city she lives in.

35
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:16,380
真是鱼龙混杂啊
So much diversity.

36
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,280
快把钱包放你前面的口袋里
Keep your wallet in your front pocket.

37
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,880
我的鞋带散了
My shoe's untied.

38
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:21,580
小乖乖 是哦 来 先坐下
Oh, sweetie, it is. Here, have a seat.

39
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,380
就这里 好样的 小兔兔拿好
Right here. There you go. Hey, hold bunny.

40
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,720
-不 不 不 不 -小兔兔
- No! No, no, no, no, no, no! - Bunny!

41
00:01:27,761 --> 00:01:28,988
你怎么就没接住呢 米奇尔
How did you miss that, Mitchell?

42
00:01:28,988 --> 00:01:30,044
列车长 我...
Mr. Conductor! I-I...

43
00:01:30,044 --> 00:01:30,876
那什么
What?

44
00:01:30,876 --> 00:01:32,185
我在给手消毒呢
I was purell-ing!

45
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,720
我不就这样嘛 你干嘛突然扔过来
And it's me! Why would you toss it?

46
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,940
我手忙不过来了这理由充分吗
Because my hands were full?

47
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:37,320
还我小兔兔
I want bunny!

48
00:01:37,770 --> 00:01:39,560
知道 好的 我有个主意
I know. W--okay, I have an idea.

49
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,560
我们赶下一班城铁 然后去追前面那班
Let's catch the next train and ride it till it catches up.

50
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,980
城铁是追不上的 追上了那叫追尾
They don't catch up. That's called a collision.

51
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:45,120
那行你说 你想一个更好的办法呢
Okay, well, do you have a better idea?

52
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:47,320
-就是你弄丢的 -不 是你扔丢的
- You're the one that lost it. - No, you tossed it.

53
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:49,060
扔的人才是弄丢的人
He who tossed it lost it.

54
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:50,400
别为了推卸责任跟我耍嘴皮子
Don't try to clever your way out of this.

55
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,640
爸爸弄丢了兔兔
Daddy lost bunny.

56
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,560
她说的是你
She means you.

57
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:56,280
自打小时候我就梦想着能有这么一辆车
Oh, I wanted a car like this since I was a kid.

58
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:57,260
我也是
Me, too.

59
00:01:57,980 --> 00:02:00,120
我曾想象着那风掠过我的发梢
I used to imagine the wind blowing through my perm,

60
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,500
再配上霍尔与奥兹的歌
blasting some Hall & Oates,

61
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:04,780
和我的麦克疯先生一起逍遥自在
maybe horsing around with my Mr. Microphone...

62
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,180
得了 那会儿咱俩还没那么熟
Yeah, we wouldn't have been friends back then.

63
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:08,920
心动不如行动啊
You should buy it.

64
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,600
不 这太不切实际了
No, it's not practical.

65
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,840
实际 你见过人临死之前躺床上
Practical? You never see a person on their deathbed

66
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,637
说 "我要是在活得在实际点就好了"
saying, "I wish I'd have been more practical."

67
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,720
临死之人的肺腑之言我见得多了 菲尔
I see a lot of people on their deathbed, Phil.

68
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:18,340
多了去了
A lot.

69
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:20,620
你手下的病人都是胳膊腿伤 不至于辞世吧
I thought you operated on knees and elbows.

70
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,720
菲尔 这车真的不错
Phil, this is a nice car.

71
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:24,600
价格也只有新车的一半而已
And it's half the price of a new car.

72
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,160
你要是不买 我就上了
If you don't buy it, I will.

73
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:28,320
克莱尔知道可怎么办
What would Claire say?

74
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:31,820
那好吧 我们去找那种特殊构造的车
You know what? Maybe we should find you

75
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:33,404
那种可以让你挺直腰杆的车
Something with a little more lumbar support.

76
00:02:33,404 --> 00:02:35,355
知道吗 你要是自己连个主心骨都没有
Yeah. You know, with you not having a spine and all.

77
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,740
-我有主心骨 -你确定你有主心骨吗
- I have a spine. - Do you have a spine?

78
00:02:37,940 --> 00:02:39,760
-我有主心骨 -要去兜风测测性能吗
- I have a spine. - So wanna take it for a spin?

79
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:41,820
这样吧 我更想测测她的"性能"
You know what? I'd rather take her for a spin.

80
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:43,060
赶紧把她放平整利索了
Let's get her top down

81
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:43,940
看看她"性能"如何
and see what she can do.

82
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:45,961
我... 我说的是那敞篷车
I'm--no, I meant the convertible.

83
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:04,020
我刚跟那大堂经理聊了下
Well, I just talked to the concierge,

84
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:05,720
客房服务能帮我留一块面包布丁
and room service will save me a bread pudding.

85
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:06,940
那我总算放心了
Load off my mind.

86
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,860
尽管嘲笑我 不过《旅游与休闲》杂志
You mock me, but "Travel and leisure"

87
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:10,000
可说了那是不能错过的美食
Says it's not to be missed.

88
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:12,900
这周末 我们一家要去卵石滩[加州]
This weekend, we're going up to pebble beach.

89
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:16,120
去会会那群高中的橄榄球队友们
I'm gonna meet a bunch of guys I played high school football with.

90
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,020
天啊 那段岁月可真是难忘
Man, those were the good old days.

91
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:19,860
是啊 但当年你要是女人或者
Yeah, unless you were a woman,

92
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:21,860
黑人 西裔 同性恋那日子就糟糕了
black, hispanic, or gay.

93
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,080
没错 不过你要是一个白种的直男
True, but if you were a straight white guy

94
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,920
还打橄榄球
who played football,

95
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:27,300
每一天都是快乐的好日子
you really couldn't have a bad day.

96
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:29,600
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

97
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,000
我该戴哪块表
Which watch should I pack?

98
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,540
这块霸气外漏 这款价值连城
This one's showier. This one's more expensive.

99
00:03:33,891 --> 00:03:35,820
就一块表而已你干嘛那么在乎
Why do you care so much about a watch?

100
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:37,460
我要怎么跟你说才不会显得太臭屁呢
How do I say this without sounding like an ass?

101
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,840
那帮人可当我是个传奇人物
I'm kind of a legend to these guys.

102
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:41,540
这么说不行
Not like that.

103
00:03:51,140 --> 00:03:52,320
瞧瞧酷爹风范
Who's your daddy?

104
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:54,500
哇哦 这车是谁的啊
Whoa! Whose car is this?

105
00:03:54,620 --> 00:03:56,420
-我的 -我说服他买的
- Mine! - I talked him into it.

106
00:03:56,431 --> 00:03:58,780
真的吗 买这车老妈没意见吗
Seriously? Mom's gonna let you have this?

107
00:03:58,780 --> 00:04:00,660
卢克 卢克 卢克...
Luke, Luke, Luke...

108
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,820
你妈人呢
Where is she?

109
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:03,540
老爸 我觉得这样不好
Dad, I don't like this.

110
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:04,260
为什么
Why not?

111
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,320
我朋友茉莉她爸就买了辆跑车
My friend Molly's dad bought a sports car,

112
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,800
现在他住在一个单间公寓里
and now he lives in a studio apartment

113
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,580
跟一个在"永驻21岁"上班的姑娘约会
and dates a girl who works at Forever 21,

114
00:04:09,660 --> 00:04:11,420
那姑娘可两年后才到21岁
which she won't be for two years.

115
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:12,700
听到没
Hear that?

116
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:14,860
宝贝们 我不会抛下你们母亲的
Honey, I'm not leaving your mom.

117
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,200
或许还真由不得你
Might not be your call.

118
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,940
我的天啊 这车太炫了
Oh, my god, it's so pretty!

119
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:20,280
我爱死它了 也爱死你了
I love it! And I love you,

120
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:22,120
我答应你 一定格外小心地驾驶它
and I promise I'll take super good care of it!

121
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:22,920
能让我来说吗
Can I tell her?

122
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:24,740
求你了 我要求的事并不多
Please. I ask for so little.

123
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:26,080
艾丽克斯 姐妹俩要和睦
Alex, be nice to your sister.

124
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:27,180
这是老爸的车 不是你的
It's dad's car, not yours.

125
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:30,180
说什么 年老的你和这新潮的车不搭啊
What? But you're too old for this!

126
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:31,920
就跟去年一个样
It's just like last year

127
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,920
你死也不愿意脱下那些紧身牛仔裤
when you wouldn't take off those skinny jeans.

128
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:34,920
不愿脱 还是 没法脱
Wouldn't or couldn't?

129
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,260
我穿着可性感呢
Hey. I looked hot.

130
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:38,060
你配上这车也一样性感
And you look hot in this car.

131
00:04:38,340 --> 00:04:39,820
让我来告诉你们一些你们老爸的事儿
Let me tell you something about your dad.

132
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:41,660
你们的爸爸是个目标明确的人
Your dad is a man who knows what he wants,

133
00:04:41,660 --> 00:04:42,560
而且说到做到
and he gets it.

134
00:04:43,820 --> 00:04:44,880
反正我是这么听说的
At least that's what I heard.

135
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:48,180
你们懂的 当局者迷 朋观者清嘛
You know, I was there more as a friend and an observer than anything.

136
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:50,680
-安德瑞 -你好 克莱尔
- Andre. - Hey, Claire.

137
00:04:51,609 --> 00:04:53,408
亲爱的 这是你买的新车吗
Honey. Is this the new car?

138
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,860
我知道看起来不实用
I know it looks impractical,

139
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:57,500
不过安德瑞跟我说了好些临死之人的事
but Andre's seen a lot of people die.

140
00:04:57,660 --> 00:04:58,140
我没有不高兴
I'm not upset.

141
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,740
没生气 这车挺漂亮
I'm not upset. It's a beautiful car.

142
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:03,260
就是惊讶你没买辆大车 仅此而已
Just surprised you didn't get the sedan, that's all.

143
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,080
不错
Beautiful.

144
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,151
见到你很高兴 克莱...
Good seeing, you, Cl--

145
00:05:07,151 --> 00:05:08,685
真的很漂亮
Mm. It's beautiful.

146
00:05:11,860 --> 00:05:12,740
刚刚是怎么回事
What just happened?

147
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:14,360
她眼都没眨一下
She did not blink once.

148
00:05:15,183 --> 00:05:16,432
进去坐一会儿吧
Do you wanna come in for a minute?

149
00:05:16,432 --> 00:05:18,040
不了 我得 你知道 找我老婆去
No, I gotta... You know, I gotta get to the wife.

150
00:05:18,049 --> 00:05:18,740
你要不要
Well, do you...

151
00:05:18,740 --> 00:05:20,920
-要不要我送你一程 -不用 不用
- Uh, do you need a ride or anything? - No. No, no,

152
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,115
我打算 跑回去
I'm gonna, uh, I'm-a jog.

153
00:05:22,167 --> 00:05:23,923
-你干嘛跑啊 -我跑步回去就行了
- Why--why are you running? - I'm just gonna jog!

154
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:29,760
莉莉没了兔兔 一晚上没合眼
Lily was up all night because she didn't have bunny,

155
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:32,440
我们也跟着不能睡
which means that we were up all night

156
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:34,420
因为她的兔兔没了
because she didn't have bunny.

157
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,660
天呐 她肯定哭了有
God, she must have cried for...

158
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:37,880
多久来着 小卡
How long was it, Cam?

159
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,840
小卡 小卡
Cam. Cam.

160
00:05:40,604 --> 00:05:41,615
不好意思
Oh, sorry.

161
00:05:41,744 --> 00:05:43,500
昨晚上太混乱了 因为莉莉的
Uh, last night was rough because Lily...

162
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:44,840
-说过了 -兔兔不见了
- Covered it. - didn't have bunny.

163
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:50,080
杰 说啊 我们到跑道上来干嘛
Jay, tell me, why are we on the runway?

164
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,920
大惊喜 我们要乘私人飞机去
Surprise! We're taking a private plane.

165
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,240
我还从没坐过私人飞机呢
Wow! I've never been on a private plane!

166
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,600
以后也别想坐
And you never will.

167
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:59,060
我不会上那个小玩意儿的
I am not getting on that little thing!

168
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:02,260
要是皮筋断了 我们掉下来怎么办
What if the rubber band snaps and we fall out of the sky?

169
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:04,460
安全系数很高的 人家是正规航空公司
It's perfectly safe. It's a legitimate airline!

170
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:05,360
你们好
Hey, folks.

171
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:07,400
怎么有三个人
Whoa. Nobody said three.

172
00:06:07,940 --> 00:06:09,360
好吧 起飞前
All right. Before we take off,

173
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,773
我得登记一下各位的体重
I'm gonna need to get everyone's weight here.

174
00:06:10,773 --> 00:06:13,056
-没问题 我有190磅 -好的
- No problem. I'm about 190. - Okay.

175
00:06:13,066 --> 00:06:15,280
那样的话 我275磅
Oh, yeah. In that case, I'm 275.

176
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:17,960
歌洛莉亚 我不会让你和曼尼有危险的
Gloria, I would never put you and Manny in danger.

177
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:20,220
走吧 相信我这一回
Now come on! Trust me on this!

178
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,260
太棒了
Beautiful.

179
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,900
这一路都得听美国音乐
It's American music the whole way,

180
00:06:29,150 --> 00:06:30,522
谁也别说话
and I don't wanna hear a word.

181
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:46,620
-怎么样了 跑车男 -棒极了
- How you doing there, sport? - Great. Yeah.

182
00:06:46,620 --> 00:06:47,960
帅呆了 你知道帅在哪儿吗
Awesome. You know what's awesome?

183
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:50,500
这辆车的发动机在后备箱里
Is this car has the engine in the trunk,

184
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:52,400
这就意味着我得...
so that means I get to...

185
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:55,520
把这些展板放在座位上 真酷
Put these signs in the seat, which is cool.

186
00:06:55,940 --> 00:06:57,200
是相当酷
Very cool.

187
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:03,960
怎么了
What?

188
00:07:04,085 --> 00:07:06,980
没什么 客户想让我
Oh, nothing. My, uh, client just wants me

189
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:08,760
载她一起过去看房
to pick her up on the way to the open house,

190
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:11,107
没问题 我只要把展板拿下来
which is great. I'll, uh, drop the sign off

191
00:07:11,107 --> 00:07:13,687
然后穿过镇子
and just swing across town to...

192
00:07:13,900 --> 00:07:16,600
她还要带上她妈妈和设计师
Oh. She's bringing her mom and a designer.

193
00:07:16,695 --> 00:07:18,280
说不定后备箱坐得下
Well, maybe they'll fit in the trunk.

194
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,040
就知道你会撒气
Here it comes!

195
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:21,200
哪里 我开玩笑的
What? I was making a joke.

196
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:22,800
小女子 你耍的什么把戏
What's your game, woman?

197
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:25,620
没什么 你是成年人 能自己做主
I have no game. You're an adult. You can make your own choices.

198
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:26,980
我什么时候有这待遇了
Since when?

199
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,782
你想借用这面包车吗
Do you wanna borrow the minivan?

200
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:30,320
对 求求你了
Yes, please.

201
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,600
行 那你去接孩子放学
Okay, fine. Then you're gonna have to pick up the kids from school.

202
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:35,420
好吧 我投降
Okay, I can't take it.

203
00:07:35,458 --> 00:07:36,814
你想说什么 尽管往我这儿招呼吧
If you got something to say, just say it.

204
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:37,880
我无话可说
I have nothing to say.

205
00:07:38,504 --> 00:07:41,561
-不言自明了 -随你怎么想吧
- That just says it all. - Well...Ok.

206
00:07:45,294 --> 00:07:47,240
行 好 谢了 塞丽娜
All--all right. Thank you, Serena.

207
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:47,760
晚上见
See you tonight.

208
00:07:48,553 --> 00:07:51,134
好消息 他们帮我把按摩时间调早上了
Good news--they rescheduled my massage for the morning.

209
00:07:51,504 --> 00:07:52,815
坏消息是按摩师换成男的了
Bad news--it's a dude.

210
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:54,580
别怪我 要怪怪你妈
Don't blame me. It's your mom's fault.

211
00:07:54,653 --> 00:07:56,950
你知道有多少人因为乘这种飞机丧命了吗
Do you know how many people have died in these planes?

212
00:07:57,180 --> 00:07:57,960
约翰·丹沃
John Denver,

213
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:58,880
佩茜·克琳
Patsy Cline,

214
00:07:58,880 --> 00:07:59,851
里奇·瓦伦斯
Ritchie Valens.

215
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:01,320
就你那破锣嗓 我保你没事
I've heard you sing. I think you're safe.

216
00:08:02,140 --> 00:08:02,668
行了 听着
All right, look,

217
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:04,460
欢迎晚宴四小时后开始
The welcome dinner starts in four hours.

218
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:05,680
我们开到那儿要五个小时
It's a 5-hour drive.

219
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,760
路上没时间上厕所了
No bathroom breaks.

220
00:08:08,998 --> 00:08:11,054
所以我劝你还是少喝点儿
Yeah, I think you're gonna want to hold on to that cup.

221
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:12,540
糟糕
Damn it!

222
00:08:12,860 --> 00:08:14,400
-怎么回事 -一个大坑
- What was that? - Giant pothole.

223
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,300
撞得火花四溅了都
The dash is lighting up like a christmas tree.

224
00:08:16,354 --> 00:08:17,440
轮胎破了
Tire's blown!

225
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,140
要是在天上就不会有这种事了
This never would have happened if we were in the air!

226
00:08:19,223 --> 00:08:21,239
要是天上发生这种事 我们就没活路了
If this had happened in the air, we wouldn't be in the air.

227
00:08:21,239 --> 00:08:22,953
我们就上天堂唱摇滚了
We would be in rock 'n' roll heaven!

228
00:08:25,280 --> 00:08:26,380
你觉得怎么样
Okay, what do you think?

229
00:08:26,657 --> 00:08:28,320
我打算把这些贴到地铁里去
I'm gonna put these in the subway.

230
00:08:29,039 --> 00:08:31,000
这张看起来好像是莉莉丢了
Okay, it looks like, uh, Lily's missing

231
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,620
然后我们悬赏25美元把她找回来
and we're offering $25 to get her back.

232
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:34,720
荒唐 正常的人怎么会...
Oh, don't be ridiculous. No one in their right mind--

233
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:36,140
好吧 现在我也这么觉得了
Okay. That's all I see now.

234
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:39,040
-这张呢 -我看看
- How about this one? - Okay. Um...

235
00:08:39,177 --> 00:08:41,563
毛绒兔子失踪 毛色灰白相间
"Missing--stuffed bunny. Brown and white fur.

236
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,800
富有同情心的眼神 解释一下这句
Sympathetic eyes." What are sympathetic eyes?

237
00:08:43,980 --> 00:08:44,740
反正不是你那样
Not those.

238
00:08:45,881 --> 00:08:47,680
我只是 没法接受
I just--I don't really love the idea

239
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:49,360
把我们的电话号码贴得地铁里到处都是
of our phone number being up in the subway.

240
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,860
行 那我们换个方式
Okay, let's play a different game.

241
00:08:50,900 --> 00:08:52,900
我来提问 你来解决 如何
How about I be the problem, and you be the solution?

242
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,500
对不起 我不应该吹毛求疵的
I'm sorry. I shouldn't be so critical.

243
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:57,490
我知道你不过是想 有了
I know you're just trying to--got it!

244
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:58,560
突然想到一个好主意
Just came up with a better idea.

245
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:01,420
花了我五秒钟不到
Took me less than five seconds.

246
00:09:09,033 --> 00:09:10,067
我看看
Okay...

247
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,100
我听不见 什么
I can't hear you. What?

248
00:09:15,980 --> 00:09:16,360
窗玻璃摇下来
Window.

249
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:17,440
我不会弄
I don't know...

250
00:09:18,786 --> 00:09:20,320
我按了什么
Gah! What did I do?

251
00:09:20,710 --> 00:09:21,978
天呐
Oh. Oh, my.

252
00:09:22,022 --> 00:09:24,513
-你好 -你好 车不错
- Yes. Hi. - Hey, nice car.

253
00:09:24,580 --> 00:09:25,180
谢谢
Thank you.

254
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,840
你是去海边吗 还是
You gonna drive up the coast, or...

255
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,400
不是 就是去办点事
Oh, no. I'm gonna do some errands, actually.

256
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:33,140
有些人可能会去买辆离谱的车
Yeah, 'cause other people might go and buy a crazy car

257
00:09:33,223 --> 00:09:35,725
发动机还在后备箱里 我可不会
with an engine in the-- in the trunk, but not me.

258
00:09:35,725 --> 00:09:37,476
不 我是个负责任的人
No. I'm responsible. Mm-hmm.

259
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:40,760
我们有三个孩子 这车怎么坐得下
We have three kids. You can't pick up three kids in this car.

260
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:41,420
根本坐不下
You can't.

261
00:09:41,477 --> 00:09:43,249
你 这个
You--it... It...

262
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:45,200
我会追上你的 来了
I'll get you... Catch ya.

263
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:47,800
走了
I'm going!

264
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,300
也许我确实有那么一点点搓火
Maybe I was a teeny bit mad.

265
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:54,580
于是我抛开琐事 驶向大海
So I blew off my errands and headed up the coast.

266
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:57,700
是时候让我潇洒走一回了
It was my turn to be irresponsible.

267
00:09:58,220 --> 00:10:00,500
幸好 我包包里还有墨镜
And luckily, I had sunscreen in my purse.

268
00:10:02,696 --> 00:10:04,903
你的车架坏了
Well, your strut's shot,

269
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:07,720
更换的零件要过一天才能到
And we can't get parts for at least a day.

270
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,740
这下好了
Fantastic.

271
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:10,800
依我看
I don't suppose

272
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:12,960
你们这儿也没租车的地方吧
there's any place you can rent cars anywhere around here?

273
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:15,558
先生 这小镇没你想象的那么落后
Know what, sir? We're not some one-horse town.

274
00:10:15,580 --> 00:10:16,540
当然能租到车
Of course you can rent a car.

275
00:10:18,640 --> 00:10:20,280
只是不巧都租完了
It just happens to be out for the day.

276
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:20,940
难以置信
Unbelievable.

277
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,360
-整个周末都泡汤了 -很抱歉 杰
- We're gonna miss the whole weekend. - I am sorry, Jay.

278
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,920
我知道他们把你看得有多重要
I know how much you mean to those guys,

279
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:28,180
也知道他们有多想见你
and I know how much they want to see you.

280
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:29,000
真是不好意思
I'm so sorry.

281
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,574
容我说一句
Uh, excuse me.

282
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,800
你真的是
You are...

283
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:33,080
太漂亮了
so pretty.

284
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:36,560
如果你们真的必须要去哪儿
And if you really need to get somewhere,

285
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:38,720
或许我能帮上忙
maybe I can help you out.

286
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:41,194
好啊 拜托了 谢谢 怎样都行
Ay, yes, please! Thank you! Anything!

287
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:46,260
瞧瞧 我私藏的宝贝
Check it out. Restored it myself.

288
00:10:48,380 --> 00:10:48,820
不行
No.

289
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:52,320
我才不在这小机场里上这架小飞机
I did not get in the little plane at the little airport!

290
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,900
死也不坐这个...
I'm not gonna get in this...

291
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:57,140
开飞机的还是那个连车都修不好的家伙
flown by that guy that couldn't fix our car!

292
00:10:57,140 --> 00:10:58,900
歌洛莉亚 要么就坐这个
Gloria, it's either this,

293
00:10:58,900 --> 00:10:59,840
要么只好住旅馆了
or we're in the motel.

294
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,580
现在这情况可不怎么乐观
I don't like the sound of that.

295
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:04,440
宾馆变成旅馆 档次立马跟着下跌
A lot of amenities disappear when an "H" Becomes an "M."

296
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,220
话说 我刚认识你那会儿
You know, when I met you,

297
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:07,760
你还从桶里扒麦片吃呢
you were eating cereal out of a bucket.

298
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:12,000
嘿 莉莉 你猜怎么着
Hey, Lily, guess what?

299
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:12,700
什么事
What?

300
00:11:12,700 --> 00:11:15,040
兔兔给我们传信了
Uh, we just heard from Bunny.

301
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,460
这办法糟透了
This is a terrible idea.

302
00:11:16,460 --> 00:11:18,108
不 这办法好极了
No, it's fantastic.

303
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,400
兔兔说 他正在经历一场华丽的冒险
Bunny said he's on an amazing adventure

304
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,920
并且特别享受那种生活
having the time of his life,

305
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:24,940
还说 你应该选一个他的好朋友
And that you should pick one of his best friends

306
00:11:24,940 --> 00:11:26,740
在他外出的这段时间陪你入眠
to sleep with while he's gone.

307
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:28,260
兔兔不会说话
Bunny doesn't talk.

308
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,420
进行得"真"顺利
This is going great.

309
00:11:29,740 --> 00:11:31,120
他现在会说了 因为
He does now, because--

310
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,060
因为他上语文课了
because he took talking lessons.

311
00:11:33,060 --> 00:11:34,520
那你想选哪一个呢
So what do you think, huh?

312
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:36,560
小海龟 还是长颈鹿
Turtle or giraffe

313
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,890
还是 小驯鹿呢
or, uh, little reindeer?

314
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:40,140
兔兔现在在哪儿
Where's bunny now?

315
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:41,600
在圣路易斯
Uh, St. Louis.

316
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:42,200
为什么
Why?

317
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,340
他去看他女朋友了
He's visiting his girlfriend.

318
00:11:45,140 --> 00:11:46,340
他没有女朋友
He doesn't have a girlfriend.

319
00:11:46,780 --> 00:11:47,820
他有个男朋友
He has a boyfriend!

320
00:11:49,580 --> 00:11:50,780
还我兔兔
I want bunny!

321
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,940
好吧 等等 莉莉
Okay. No, no, Lily.

322
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:54,057
莉莉 要不选泰迪熊吧
Lily, uh, what about miss, uh, Teddy bear?

323
00:11:54,057 --> 00:11:58,054
不好吗 那老虎博士呢 也不好吗
Huh? No? Uh, Dr. Tiger? No?

324
00:11:58,260 --> 00:11:59,160
鱼先生呢
Mr. Fish?

325
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,460
我要兔兔 我要去圣路易斯
I want bunny. I'm going to St. Louis.

326
00:12:03,180 --> 00:12:04,580
不是吧 这鱼叫"尼莫"都不知道
Really? You don't know Nemo?

327
00:12:04,920 --> 00:12:06,260
屋里可都是循环播放着的
It's on an endless loop in the den.

328
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,260
我可没那闲工夫
I have a job.

329
00:12:07,428 --> 00:12:09,600
然后博迪传球给我
And then Bodie kicked it to me,

330
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,720
我带球过了迈克 传给了泰勒
and I dribbled it past Michael and got it to Tyler...

331
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,900
开不上崭新的靓车 我很不爽
I was bummed not to be in my new cool car,

332
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:17,160
所以我没有像平时一样跟孩子们嬉闹
so I wasn't joking around with the kids like I usually do.

333
00:12:17,311 --> 00:12:19,735
要不是被那小子绊倒 我就射门得分了
And I would've scored if that kid didn't trip me.

334
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,580
裁判居然没看到
I can't believe the ref didn't see it.

335
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,280
奥利维亚肯定看到了
I bet Olivia saw it.

336
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:25,180
你踢球时 她总是盯着你
She's always watching you when you play.

337
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:27,820
是啊 我知道 似乎她很喜欢足球
Yeah, I know. It's like she's in love with soccer.

338
00:12:30,358 --> 00:12:32,296
唉 别再给我发短信了
Ugh. Stop texting me!

339
00:12:32,980 --> 00:12:33,420
怎么了
What?

340
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:35,120
是科瑞 他太黏人了
Corey. He is so clingy.

341
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:41,680
但是 开车接送孩子还是有好处的
But, you know, there's something about driving your kids around.

342
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,520
你在前排 他们在后排
You're in the front, they're in the back.

343
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:44,580
他们忘记你在那儿
They forget you're there,

344
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:45,680
于是你知道了许多小秘密
and you learn so much.

345
00:12:46,497 --> 00:12:48,553
感觉我像《雾中猩猩》里的西格妮·韦弗
You're like sigourney weaver in "Gorillas in the mist."

346
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:51,140
不过猩猩的咀嚼声比较小
Except gorillas make less noise chewing.

347
00:12:55,380 --> 00:12:58,300
一开上沿海公路 我就一路狂飙
Once I hit the coast highway, I didn't stop.

348
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,760
关掉了手机
I turned off my cell phone.

349
00:13:01,540 --> 00:13:04,440
午饭吃了鱼肉卷 真是太疯狂了
I ate fish tacos for lunch. It was insane!

350
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:06,540
好多年都没这种自由的感觉了
I haven't felt that free in years.

351
00:13:07,660 --> 00:13:10,440
压力一下子就不见踪影了
All my stress completely disappeared...

352
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:13,740
车钥匙也一并没了
And so did my keys.

353
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:25,800
抱歉 但这些标志真是傻到家了
I'm sorry, but... These signs are ridiculous.

354
00:13:25,812 --> 00:13:28,120
你说得对 我应该用赫维提卡字体
Oh, you're right. I should have used helvetica.

355
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,520
那样更符合我们目前火烧眉毛的状况
It much better represents the urgency of our situation.

356
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:32,560
不 我是说咱费尽心思就为找个娃娃
No, the lengths that we're going to for a stuffed animal.

357
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,540
小卡 该让莉莉体会什么是"失去"了
You know, cam, maybe it's time lily learned about loss.

358
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:37,850
不 她才3岁 我最懂了
No, she's 3, and I know.

359
00:13:37,850 --> 00:13:38,700
你知道吗 在农场时
Do you know how many times

360
00:13:38,700 --> 00:13:40,500
我不得不无数次和动物朋友们告别
I had to say good-bye to a furry friend on the farm?

361
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:41,820
你不正因此变得更坚强[肥壮]了吗
And didn't it make you stronger?

362
00:13:41,900 --> 00:13:43,100
没错 那时我正在长身体
Yeah, because I was a growing boy

363
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:44,500
而动物肉富含了蛋白质 高营养
and they were chock-full of protein.

364
00:13:44,500 --> 00:13:45,960
但那依然会让我心碎
But it was still heartbreaking.

365
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,180
那可以塑造人的品质
It builds character.

366
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,820
我小时候 有一回
You know, once, when I was a kid,

367
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:51,160
我爸把我的卢克·天行者玩偶遗失在机场
my dad left my Luke Skywalker doll on an airplane,

368
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,980
-我特别气 -等会儿 哪一款卢克
- and I was so angry-- - Wait, which--which Luke?

369
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:55,240
穿短袍的 还是黑衣的
Shorty robe or dress blacks?

370
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:56,700
-穿短袍的 -天呐
- Shorty robe. - Oh, my.

371
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:58,120
你知道他怎么找回它吗
And you know what he did to get it back?

372
00:13:58,120 --> 00:14:00,160
他什么都没干 什么都没
Not a damn thing. Nope.

373
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:02,660
他连动动手指头去打个电话都没有
He didn't lift one pudgy finger to make a single phone call,

374
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,260
而我挺过来了
and I got over it.

375
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,620
是啊 我希望你和莉莉
Yeah, well, I want you and Lily

376
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:07,100
能有健康的父女关系
to have the same healthy relationship

377
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:08,960
就像你和你爹那样 必须的
you and your father have. For sure.

378
00:14:10,380 --> 00:14:11,460
好吧 把传单给我
All right, give me these flyers.

379
00:14:12,300 --> 00:14:14,180
我把它们发给这些流浪汉
I'm gonna take everything to this side of the homeless guy.

380
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:14,800
米奇尔
Mitchell!

381
00:14:15,140 --> 00:14:16,300
我错了 我们该怎么称呼他们呢
Sorry, what are we supposed to say now

382
00:14:16,300 --> 00:14:17,662
无家可归的人 还是啥
Home-challenged? Or...

383
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,400
不 快看
No, look!

384
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:22,160
天呐 是兔兔
Oh, my god! It's bunny!

385
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,760
莉莉会高兴坏了的
Oh, Lily's gonna be so happy.

386
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,840
真是太好了 快去拿回来
Oh, that's so great. Go ahead and get it.

387
00:14:25,220 --> 00:14:26,280
-啥 我去 -对啊
- What, me? - Yeah.

388
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,520
干嘛让我去拿回来
Why should I go and get it?

389
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:28,960
我才不会去呢
Well, I-I'm not gonna do it.

390
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,900
为什么 是我发现的
Why? I spotted it.

391
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:30,520
你离得近
You're closer.

392
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:32,460
这是你的使命 想想"卢克·天行者"
It's your journey. Luke Skywalker?

393
00:14:32,460 --> 00:14:34,060
想想"超越自我" 想想你爹 快去
Pattern-breaking? Your father? Get in there.

394
00:14:34,060 --> 00:14:34,460
好吧
Fine.

395
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:38,045
嗨 先生
Sir--hi, sir.

396
00:14:39,350 --> 00:14:40,624
你好 你 你
Hello, you--you...

397
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:44,180
你好
Hello.

398
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:46,600
你好
Hello.

399
00:14:48,450 --> 00:14:50,745
你好 先生
He-hello? Sir...

400
00:14:50,903 --> 00:14:52,516
-我不能 -我的老天爷啊
- I-I can't... - Oh, for god sakes!

401
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:01,360
-她要恨咱就恨吧 -你心中有恨也照样成才了
- Let her hate us. - You turned out great.

402
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:03,020
-的确啊 不是吗 -你是个大律师呢
- I did, didn't I? - You're a big lawyer.

403
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:11,400
我预想中的按摩可不是这样的
This is not the massage I had in mind.

404
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:12,440
好的
All right.

405
00:15:14,780 --> 00:15:15,220
这样
Okay.

406
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:18,080
大约一小时后 有辆火车会经过这儿
In about an hour, a train goes through town

407
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,460
可以把我们带到卵石滩那儿
that will get us close to pebble beach.

408
00:15:19,965 --> 00:15:22,800
严格意义上说 那不是一辆客运火车
Now it's not technically a-a passenger train,

409
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,480
-所以不会停站 -什么
- so it won't be stopping. - What?

410
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:26,159
我们到时候得跑快点
So we gotta get running real good.

411
00:15:26,159 --> 00:15:28,380
高跟鞋就算了吧 还有带上那毛毯
No high-heeled shoes. And it wouldn't be wrong

412
00:15:28,380 --> 00:15:29,940
应该也能派上用场了吧
if we took that blanket with us, either, huh?

413
00:15:30,071 --> 00:15:33,080
你们觉得如何 来一场流浪大冒险如何
So what do you say? Anybody up for a hobo adventure?

414
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:34,700
真要投票的话 我反对
If we're voting, I'm a "No".

415
00:15:35,665 --> 00:15:37,427
曼尼 我们出去一会儿就回来
Manny, we're gonna be right back.

416
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:40,360
我们去停车场那个机器里弄点冰块回来
We're gonna get some ice from the machine in the parking lot.

417
00:15:42,660 --> 00:15:43,100
够上档次
Classy.

418
00:15:46,853 --> 00:15:49,824
杰 这是要闹哪样 有意思吗
Jay, this is getting crazy. Is it worth it?

419
00:15:49,824 --> 00:15:50,960
我就想会会三五老友而已
I wanna see the old gang.

420
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:53,420
你是真心想见他们 还是单纯想去炫耀
Do you wanna see them or you want to show off to them?

421
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,200
私人飞机啊 名贵手表啊
The private plane, the fancy watch.

422
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,620
你只是想回味
You still want to feel

423
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,640
自己在大学里当大佬的滋味吧
that you're the big kahuna on the campus.

424
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:01,640
才没有呢 我压根没往那方面想
That's not it. That's not even a thing.

425
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:03,480
算了 我要带曼尼回家了
You know what? I'm taking Manny home.

426
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:06,177
如果你执意要去坐那什么...
If you want to go in the takka-takka-takka-takka,

427
00:16:06,177 --> 00:16:08,180
成 你就一个人去吧
okay, go to pebble beach by yourself.

428
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,640
不要 说什么呢 计划不是这样的
No, what? That's not the plan.

429
00:16:10,212 --> 00:16:11,480
如果你那么想去
If you wanna go there so bad,

430
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,080
这就是唯一的办法了
that's the only way you're gonna get there.

431
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,640
不是我自己想要去那儿
I'm not trying to get me there.

432
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:16,080
我是想带你去那儿
I'm trying to get you there!

433
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:17,820
-什么 -听着
- What? - Look...

434
00:16:20,241 --> 00:16:24,437
关于当大佬的事 我有点言过其实
I may have exaggerated the size... kahuna I was.

435
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,440
我可能
I may not...

436
00:16:27,403 --> 00:16:29,717
严格意义上来说 都没当过大佬
technically have been a kahuna.

437
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:35,860
我那时很怯懦 大多时间我都是
I was shy, and I spent most of my time...

438
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:37,280
坐冷板凳
on the bench.

439
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:39,520
可你一直说得好像自己当时很...
But you always made it sound like you--

440
00:16:39,529 --> 00:16:41,305
我知道自己吹成什么样
Oh, I know what I made it sound like.

441
00:16:44,940 --> 00:16:47,380
人们都觉得我不会有大出息
People didn't expect much from me,

442
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:50,080
还有
and, um...

443
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,540
他们肯定没想到
they certainly didn't expect me

444
00:16:51,540 --> 00:16:54,820
我能娶到你这样的美人
to end up with... somebody like you.

445
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:59,060
所以你只是把我当个
So this is all about you

446
00:16:59,060 --> 00:17:01,560
战利品带过去炫耀是吗
parading me around like a trophy?

447
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:03,700
没错
Yes.

448
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,800
你干嘛早不讲
Why didn't you say so?

449
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:07,120
扮花瓶我可最在行
I can be a trophy!

450
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:12,160
好啦 赶紧把这个尤物带去卵石滩吧
Come on. We need to get this up to pebble beach.

451
00:17:12,333 --> 00:17:15,264
曼尼 出发啦 快收拾一下
Manny! We're leaving! Get ready!

452
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,160
太棒了 我们十分钟内离开的话
Oh, good. If we get out of here in the next ten minutes,

453
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,640
就只用付一个小时的房费
we don't have to pay for the second hour.

454
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,900
玩得怎么样啊 开跑车的
How you doing there, sport?

455
00:17:26,596 --> 00:17:28,796
-真抱歉 -没事啦
- I'm sorry. - That's okay.

456
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:30,040
多谢
Thanks.

457
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:31,500
那
So...

458
00:17:31,615 --> 00:17:33,309
跑这么远来做什么
Whatcha doing all the way up here?

459
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,640
是不是生气啦
Did someone snap?

460
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:39,340
没错 有一点
A little. Yeah.

461
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:41,880
就因为你买那辆破跑车
I was mad at you for buying that stupid sports car.

462
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:43,120
我就知道
I knew it!

463
00:17:43,220 --> 00:17:44,240
但我错了
And I was wrong.

464
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:48,280
这车太棒了 一整天都棒极了
It's a great car. God, I had the best day.

465
00:17:48,670 --> 00:17:50,310
菲尔 我还做了侧手翻
Phil, I did cartwheels.

466
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:51,120
不带我吗
Without me?

467
00:17:52,060 --> 00:17:52,540
对
Yeah.

468
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:00,660
你知道有小姑娘喜欢上咱家卢克了吗
Hey, did you know there's a girl with a crush on Luke?

469
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:02,340
-奥利维亚吧 -对
- Olivia. - Yeah.

470
00:18:05,004 --> 00:18:07,121
海莉跟科瑞彻底玩完了
Oh, and Haley's totally done with Corey.

471
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:08,080
那倒算新闻
That's new.

472
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,680
艾丽克斯在自学汉语
Alex is teaching herself Chinese

473
00:18:10,740 --> 00:18:12,700
等回头中国把咱全部收购后可以派上用场
so she'll be useful when they finish buying us.

474
00:18:13,740 --> 00:18:14,780
她就是个怪小孩
She's so weird.

475
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:20,300
我真的很想驾车带孩子们四处逛逛
I really want to be able to drive the kids around.

476
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:23,980
我本该买个大点的车上班用 是我错了
I need a bigger car for work. I made a mistake.

477
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:27,440
你没犯错 你买它是有原因的
No, you didn't. You bought it for a reason.

478
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:34,020
为什么咱们后来就不到海边来了
When did we stop coming to the beach?

479
00:18:35,760 --> 00:18:36,940
好像是从艾丽克斯
I think it was when Alex

480
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:39,000
绘制水质报告开始的
started printing out water quality reports.

481
00:18:39,594 --> 00:18:41,520
以后该头痛的就是中国了
She'll be China's problem soon.

482
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:43,440
你知道吗
You know...

483
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:47,280
我们并不需要跑车才能来这儿
We don't need a sports car to get out here.

484
00:18:48,020 --> 00:18:49,740
我们许下个约定好了
We should just make a pact.

485
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:52,600
每月找个机会 逃离尘嚣奔向大海
Once a month, we get out to the beach.

486
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:56,000
别人问起 就说出来办点事儿
And we tell everyone we're running errands.

487
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:57,180
-好的 -好的
- Yeah. - Yeah.

488
00:19:03,577 --> 00:19:05,274
那干洗店你还没去是吗
So you didn't get to the dry cleaner?

489
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:09,720
世人常说 生命中最重要的事
They say the important thing in life

490
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:11,066
并非抵达终点
isn't the destination.

491
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,360
而是旅途本身
It's the journey,

492
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:18,500
是一路上遇到的重重挑战
the challenges you face along the way...

493
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:22,380
是出乎意料的峰回路转
the unexpected twists and turns...

494
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:25,440
是被你击溃的失望与沮丧
the disappointments you overcome.

495
00:19:25,678 --> 00:19:27,980
看看我从网上买到什么了
Look what I found on the internet.

496
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:31,200
我的天啊 是穿着短袍的卢克·天行者
Oh, my god! It's Luke Skywalker in his shorty robe!

497
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,942
-我好喜欢 小卡 -是我的
- I love it, Cam---. - Mine!

498
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,080
但世人皆错
But they're wrong.

499
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:35,600
终点才最重要
It's all about the destination,

500
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:37,660
尤其是当终点是
especially when the destination

501
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:39,480
有超棒海景的酒店时
is your amazing oceanfront hotel.

502
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,420
再次感谢你 塞丽娜
Thank you again, Serena.

503
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:43,720
最诚挚的问候 曼尼·迪尔加多
Warmest regards, Manny Delgado.

504
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:44,840
这孩子干嘛呢
What's he doing?

505
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,860
他给那大堂经理送花呢
He's sending flowers to the concierge.

506
00:19:46,860 --> 00:19:48,671
-不是吧 -喂
- Oh, jeez. - Hey...

507
00:19:49,340 --> 00:19:49,880
信用卡号
Credit card.

508
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:57,160
你老婆让你改主意了 对吧
She wore you down, didn't she?

509
00:19:57,180 --> 00:19:58,640
跟克莱尔一点关系都没有
This is not about Claire.

510
00:19:58,640 --> 00:20:00,000
是我自己真心想把车卖给你
I really want to sell you the car.

511
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:03,580
真悲哀 你居然被女人制服了
It's sad. She got you to believe that.

512
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:04,760
不是 我
No, I...

513
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:06,660
我只是发现敞篷跑车不适合自己
Turns out I'm just not a convertible guy.

514
00:20:07,300 --> 00:20:08,960
好吧 你的便宜我来占
Well, your loss is my gain.

515
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,380
-这车多神气啊 菲尔 -对吧
- It's a sweet ride, Phil. - Right?

516
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,700
必须是
It really is.

517
00:20:17,731 --> 00:20:18,833
-不对 -咋了
- Uh-oh. - What?

518
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:20,900
我好像闻到一股霉味儿
I'm getting, like, a whiff of mildew.

519
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:23,100
没闻到啊
I don't smell anything.

520
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:27,000
没错 就是霉味
Yep. That's mildew.

521
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:29,080
这车肯定被水泡过
This car's been in the flood.

522
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:30,480
是卡特里娜飓风受灾车
It's a Katrina car!

523
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:33,540
居然把受灾车卖我 气死我了 菲尔
I'm offended that you tried to sell me a Katrina car, Phil!

524
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:35,240
你老婆不准你买敞篷车 是不是
Your wife won't let you have a convertible, will she?

525
00:20:35,286 --> 00:20:37,708
我哪知道 因为我都没胆去问
We will never know, 'cause I'm afraid to ask.

526
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:39,240
再见了 菲尔
See you later, Phil.

